239 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 123 0 R
/T (While the origins of machine learning could be traced to the 1950s, it gained wider prominence within AI during the mid-to-late 2010s. It encompasses methods that allow computers to learn patterns from data, including neural networks and random forests. Computer vision is another important domain, enabling computers to interpret and understand images and other visual information. Together, these capabilities helped expand the range of tasks that AI systems could perform, and they also offer a useful lens for tracking how demand for AI skills has evolved in Singapore.)
/E (While the origins of machine learning could be traced to the 1950s, it gained wider prominence within AI during the mid-to-late 2010s. It encompasses methods that allow computers to learn patterns from data, including neural networks and random forests. Computer vision is another important domain, enabling computers to interpret and understand images and other visual information. Together, these capabilities helped expand the range of tasks that AI systems could perform, and they also offer a useful lens for tracking how demand for AI skills has evolved in Singapore.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
