/T (In Singapore, machine learning appeared in the largest share of AI-related job ads in the last two years, although the proportion has declined over time. In the three months to August 2026, ads mentioning machine learning were 93% higher than in the same period a year earlier, the fastest growth across SEEK markets. By contrast, ads mentioning computer vision were 22.5% lower than a year earlier over the same period, while Indonesia and Malaysia recorded triple-digit growth.)
/E (In Singapore, machine learning appeared in the largest share of AI-related job ads in the last two years, although the proportion has declined over time. In the three months to August 2026, ads mentioning machine learning were 93% higher than in the same period a year earlier, the fastest growth across SEEK markets. By contrast, ads mentioning computer vision were 22.5% lower than a year earlier over the same period, while Indonesia and Malaysia recorded triple-digit growth.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [22]
