/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 136 0 R
/T (In Singapore, the Jobstreet AI Gauge shows the demand for AI-related skills has grown notably over the last two years, roughly tripling in value. The share of ads mentioning AI-related skills is also increasing over time but remains relatively small \(5.1% in August 2026\). The rise in agentic AI-related terms in job ads has been particularly fast recently.)
/E (In Singapore, the Jobstreet AI Gauge shows the demand for AI-related skills has grown notably over the last two years, roughly tripling in value. The share of ads mentioning AI-related skills is also increasing over time but remains relatively small \(5.1% in August 2026\). The rise in agentic AI-related terms in job ads has been particularly fast recently.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
