/P 137 0 R
/T (Such an example matches many of the AI terms used to identify AI-related job ads. These AI-related messages to candidates typically appear at the end of a job ad, so to reduce the possibility of identifying these ads as being AI-related jobs the last 500 characters of job ads have been ignored.)
/E (Such an example matches many of the AI terms used to identify AI-related job ads. These AI-related messages to candidates typically appear at the end of a job ad, so to reduce the possibility of identifying these ads as being AI-related jobs the last 500 characters of job ads have been ignored.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
539 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 137 0 R
/T (Care has been taken to try and avoid including these false positives in the Jobstreet AI Gauge, but false positives may have slipped through. Rather than a relatively quick and energy-efficient text-matching exercise, a large language model could be used to tag each relevant ad over the past decade as having an AI-skills requirement, but this is more time- and energy-consuming and still may result in some false positives.)
/E (Care has been taken to try and avoid including these false positives in the Jobstreet AI Gauge, but false positives may have slipped through. Rather than a relatively quick and energy-efficient text-matching exercise, a large language model could be used to tag each relevant ad over the past decade as having an AI-skills requirement, but this is more time- and energy-consuming and still may result in some false positives.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
