/Title (AI has evolved quickly in recent years, and the demand for employees with AI-enabling skills has grown rapidly as organisations look to unlock the promise of AI.1 The Jobstreet AI Gauge measures the change in this demand over time by counting the number of job ads on Jobstreet that include at least one AI-related term.)
