/Title (The AI terms used to identify demand for AI skills in Jobstreet job ads cover a range of AI concepts, models and software which can be classified in various ways. To get a broad sense of which types of AI knowledge are in demand, we have roughly classified the terms into 12 indicative non-mutually exclusive categories \(see Appendix Table 1\).)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2649 0 R
/Next 2786 0 R
>>
